 if(coverage<40)suggestion={label:L('PRIČEKAJ PODATKE','WAIT FOR DATA'),text:L('Signal još nema dovoljnu pokrivenost. Ne donositi zaključak dok se ne učita barem 40% Focus 100 universea.','The signal does not yet have enough coverage. Do not draw a conclusion until at least 40% of the Focus 100 universe has loaded.')};
 else if((Number.isFinite(caution)&&caution>=80)||regime==='WEAKNESS ALREADY VISIBLE')suggestion={label:L('DEFENZIVNO','DEFENSIVE'),text:L('Ne povećavati tržišni rizik agresivno. Izbjegavati leverage, nove ulaze rasporediti u više koraka i tražiti stabilizaciju breadth-a, sektora i kredit/volatilnost potvrde.','Do not increase market risk aggressively. Avoid leverage, stagger new entries and look for stabilization in breadth, sectors and credit/volatility confirmation.')};
