function companyFromSeries(entry,series){let m=marketMetrics(series),meta=sourceMeta(series);if(!m)return null;let core=companyCoreRiskParts(m),dividend=dividendSummaryFromSeries(series,m.value),rec={schema:COMPANY_SUMMARY_SCHEMA,symbol:entry.s,name:meta.longName||meta.shortName||entry.n||entry.s,shortName:meta.shortName||null,exchange:meta.exchangeName||entry.ex||'',currency:meta.currency||'',value:m.value,d1:m.d1,m1:m.m1,m3:m.m3,ytd:m.ytd,y1:m.y1,dist50:m.dist50,dist200:m.dist200,draw52:m.draw52,rv20:m.rv20,coreRisk:core.score,risk:core.score,riskParts:core,dividend,date:m.date,status:'ready',ts:Date.now()};companySummaries[entry.s]=rec;scheduleCompanySummaryPersist();return rec}
