function buildMacroCycle(f,countries){let inflation=inflationDetector(f),recession=recessionLeadingAndComposite(f),i=inflation.score,r=recession.score,haveI=Number.isFinite(i),haveR=Number.isFinite(r),regime=!haveI&&!haveR?'DATA UNAVAILABLE':haveI!==haveR?'PARTIAL MACRO DATA':i>=60&&r>=60?'STAGFLATION RISK':i>=60&&r<60?'INFLATION-DOMINANT RISK':r>=60&&i<60?'RECESSION-DOMINANT RISK':r>=45&&i<45?'DISINFLATIONARY SLOWDOWN':i<45&&r<45?'SOFT-LANDING / NORMAL':'MIXED MACRO RISK',score=avg([i,r]),meaningHr=regime==='DATA UNAVAILABLE'?'Službeni makro podaci trenutačno nisu dostupni. Aplikacija ne izmišlja vrijednosti; pokušaj ponovno ili provjeri Data Sources.':regime==='PARTIAL MACRO DATA'?'Dostupan je samo dio makro signala. Prikazani score koristi samo valjane komponente i zato ga treba tumačiti uz prikazanu pokrivenost.':regime==='STAGFLATION RISK'?'Inflacijski i recesijski rizik rastu istodobno. To je najteži policy mix jer centralne banke imaju manje prostora za brzo ublažavanje uvjeta bez ponovnog inflacijskog pritiska.':regime==='INFLATION-DOMINANT RISK'?'Inflacijski pritisci dominiraju dok recesijski signali još nisu široko potvrđeni. Glavni tržišni rizik su više stope i kompresija valuacija.':regime==='RECESSION-DOMINANT RISK'?'Recesijski signali dominiraju uz slabiji inflacijski pritisak. To povećava rizik pada zarada i kreditnog stresa, ali dugoročne stope mogu dobiti više prostora za pad.':regime==='SOFT-LANDING / NORMAL'?'Ni inflacija ni recesijski indikatori ne pokazuju široki alarm prema dostupnim podacima. To nije jamstvo rasta tržišta, nego povoljniji makro režim.':'Makro signali su mješoviti; potrebno je pratiti smjer i potvrdu više kategorija.',meaningEn=regime==='DATA UNAVAILABLE'?'Official macro data are temporarily unavailable. The app does not invent values; retry or check Data Sources.':regime==='PARTIAL MACRO DATA'?'Only part of the macro signal set is available. The displayed score uses valid components only and should be read together with coverage.':regime==='STAGFLATION RISK'?'Inflation and recession risk are rising at the same time. This is the hardest policy mix because central banks have less room to ease quickly without reigniting inflation.':regime==='INFLATION-DOMINANT RISK'?'Inflation pressures dominate while recession signals are not broadly confirmed. The main market risk is higher rates and valuation compression.':regime==='RECESSION-DOMINANT RISK'?'Recession signals dominate while inflation pressure is weaker. This raises earnings and credit risk, while leaving more room for long-term yields to fall.':regime==='SOFT-LANDING / NORMAL'?'Neither inflation nor recession indicators show a broad alarm in the available data. This is not a market-return guarantee, only a more favorable macro regime.':'Macro signals are mixed; direction and confirmation across categories matter.';return{score:Number.isFinite(score)?Math.round(score):null,regime,inflation,recession,meaningHr,meaningEn,generatedAt:new Date().toISOString()}}

