async function exportDataV47(){try{setExportStatusV47(L('Priprema izvoza…','Preparing export…'));let snap=auditSnapshotV47(),markets=marketAuditRowsV47(),fiscal=fiscalAuditRowsV47(),macro=macroAuditRowsV47(),corr=correlationAuditRowsV47(),commod=commodityAuditRowsV47(),early=earlyAuditRowsV47(),global=globalRiskAuditRowsV47(),meta=snap.app,readme=`Market Risk Monitor Global+ ${EXPORT_V47_VERSION}\nAudit snapshot generated ${meta.generatedAt}\n\nCURRENT SNAPSHOT exports only state already loaded/calculated in the app. It triggers zero network requests. Missing modules are marked NOT_LOADED/UNAVAILABLE/LIMITED_DATA. Secrets and credential-like keys are recursively removed.\n`,files=[{name:'data_snapshot.json',data:JSON.stringify(snap,null,2)},{name:'markets.csv',data:csvV47(markets)},{name:'fiscal.csv',data:csvV47(fiscal)},{name:'macro.csv',data:csvV47(macro)},{name:'correlations.csv',data:csvV47(corr)},{name:'commodities.csv',data:csvV47(commod)},{name:'early_warning.csv',data:csvV47(early)},{name:'global_risk.csv',data:csvV47(global)},{name:'metadata.json',data:JSON.stringify(meta,null,2)},{name:'README.txt',data:readme}],blob=zipStoreV47(files),name=`MarketRiskMonitor_Data_v${EXPORT_V47_VERSION}_${exportTimestampV47()}.zip`,saved=await saveExportBlobV48(blob,name,'application/zip');setExportStatusV47(saved.native?L('Spremljeno: ','Saved: ')+saved.name:L('Pokrenuto je preuzimanje u pregledniku; potvrda spremanja nije dostupna.','Browser download started; save confirmation is unavailable.'))}catch(e){setExportStatusV47(L('Greška pri preuzimanju: ','Download failed: ')+String(e&&e.message||e),false)}}
function methodologyMarkdownV47(){let weights=getWeights(),fiscalWeights={debt:15,debtTrend:15,balance:15,primary:10,interest:15,financing:10,refiGap:10,rMinusG:10},ts=new Date().toISOString();return `# Market Risk Monitor Global+ — Calculation Methodology\n\nApplication version: ${EXPORT_V47_VERSION} (versionCode ${EXPORT_V47_CODE})\nGenerated: ${ts}\nLanguage at export: ${currentLang}\n\nThis document describes the calculations implemented in this release. It is an audit aid, not investment advice. Missing inputs are not silently replaced with zero.\n\n## 1. Country / Market Risk\nPurpose: composite country-market stress score.\nActive weights (user-configurable): ${JSON.stringify(weights)}\nAggregation: weighted average over finite available subscores only; missing categories are excluded and remaining weights are renormalized, but a normal color/status is shown only after the Phase-2 eligibility gate passes.\nCoverage semantics: DATA COVERAGE = available expected raw inputs; FACTOR COVERAGE = represented independent factor groups; FRESHNESS COVERAGE = configured model weight backed by CURRENT or OLD_BUT_CURRENT_RELEASE inputs. Effective weighted coverage is min(weighted available coverage, freshness coverage). Eligibility requires >= ${COUNTRY_MIN_EFFECTIVE_COVERAGE_V50}% effective weighted coverage, >= ${COUNTRY_MIN_FACTOR_GROUPS_V50} independent factor groups, and a market factor. Failure => LIMITED DATA while the numeric score remains diagnostic.\nStatus mapping after eligibility: <25 GREEN; <45 LIGHT GREEN; <60 ORANGE; <75 DARK ORANGE; otherwise RED.\nSource functions: marketMetrics(), marketRisk(), macroRiskFromWB(), fxRisk(), trendRisk(), weightedScore(), riskBand().\n\n## 2. Global Market Health / Equity Internals\nWeights: ${JSON.stringify(EQUITY_INTERNAL_WEIGHTS)}\nEligibility: at least 60 valid history observations, finite internals score and positive coverage. Global score requires at least ${EQUITY_GLOBAL_MIN_COVERAGE_PCT_V42}% eligible-market coverage.\nSource functions: equityInternalsRecord(), equityGlobalEligibilityV42(), aggregateEquityInternalsV42().\n\n## 3. GLOBAL Risk\nWeights: ${JSON.stringify(GLOBAL_WEIGHTS)}\nAggregation: weighted average across finite components only; the numeric score formula remains unchanged. Coverage is no longer inferred only from top-level component presence. GLOBAL Risk reports internal DATA COVERAGE, weighted FACTOR COVERAGE, FRESHNESS COVERAGE, SOURCE VALIDITY COVERAGE and their conservative effective minimum. Eligibility requires >= ${GLOBAL_MIN_EFFECTIVE_COVERAGE_V50}% effective coverage and >= ${GLOBAL_MIN_FACTOR_GROUPS_V50} represented top-level factor groups; otherwise status is LIMITED DATA.\nSource functions: globalRiskModel(), riskBand().\n\n## 4. Global Contagion\nInputs: average cross-market correlation, share of markets with >=8% 52-week drawdown, and average realized-volatility risk.\nSource function: globalContagion().\n\n## 5. Macro — Inflation / Recession\nInflation weights: ${JSON.stringify(INFLATION_WEIGHTS)}\nRecession weights: ${JSON.stringify(RECESSION_WEIGHTS)}\nBoth models normalize over available weighted components and report coverage/confidence.\nSource functions: inflationDetector(), recessionLeadingAndComposite(), buildMacroCycle().\n\n## 6. Correlation / Correlation Regime\nCorrelation uses aligned daily returns rather than index levels. UI windows include 20D / 60D / 120D / 252D / 3Y. Regime diagnostics compare short and medium windows and breadth.\nSource functions: corrMatrix(), correlationRegimeFromStats(), correlationRegimeDiagnostic().\n\n## 7. Early Warning\nSignals use source-specific transforms into 0–100 risk scores. Missing feeds are excluded rather than imputed. Cross-asset and macro detector composites are added only when available.\nSource functions: usEarly(), completeEarly(), enrichEarlySources().\n\n## 8. S&P 500 / Equity Internals\nUses price structure, breadth, leadership, size participation, sector breadth, volatility term structure, tail risk, correlation dispersion and drawdown velocity.\nSource functions: sp500HiddenWeakness(), equityInternalsRecord().\n\n## 9. Sovereign Fiscal Stress\nWeights: ${JSON.stringify(fiscalWeights)}\nMinimum score gate: at least 4 valid weighted components AND at least one debt-stock metric, one fiscal-flow metric and one market-financing metric.\nStatus mapping: <35 NORMAL; <50 WATCH; <70 ELEVATED; otherwise HIGH STRESS. Missing/insufficient data => LIMITED DATA.\nFreshness: stale observations are excluded from current score/rankings; ACTUAL, ESTIMATE and FORECAST are distinguished. Current-reference precedence follows fiscalPickReferenceV44().\nSource functions: fiscalScoreRowsV43(), fiscalBandV43(), fiscalFreshnessV44(), fiscalPickReferenceV44().\n\n## 10. Commodities\nPrice shock diagnostics combine price momentum, realized volatility and drawdown where available. Physical storage/reserve modules retain provider-specific units and denominators.\nSource functions: commodityShockRisk(), existing commodity V19/V24/V32 render/calculation functions.\n\n## 11. GIE AGSI+\nWorking Gas Volume (WGV) is technical capacity; gasInStorage is current stored gas; fill is bounded storage utilization. Missing values are not treated as zero. Country/facility parsers preserve official observation dates and coverage.\nSource functions: agsiApiJsonV33(), parseAgsiPayloadV33(), parseAgsiFacilityListingV37(), buildAgsiFacilitiesV37(), renderThinProgressV38().\n\n## 12. Company Risk\nCore company-risk weights: momentum 40%, drawdown 25%, volatility 20%, technical 15%. Momentum subweights: 1M 30%, 3M 45%, 1Y 25%. Technical subweights: distance-to-50DMA 45%, distance-to-200DMA 55%.\nSource function: companyCoreRiskParts().\n\n## 13. ETF Logic\nETF risk reuses the loaded company-summary core risk (or fallback risk) for the ETF symbol; ACC/DIST classification is presentation metadata.\nSource function: etfRisk().\n\n## 14. Dividend Logic\nDividend-safety weights: history 30%, growth 20%, consistency 20%, market 20%, yield quality 10%. Missing components are normalized through the same weighted-company helper.\nSource function: dividendSafety().\n\n## Data quality rules\n- Missing is never zero.\n- Provider/source metadata, observation dates, retrieval time, frequency and freshness are retained where available. General freshness distinguishes CURRENT, LATE, OLD_BUT_CURRENT_RELEASE, STALE and UNKNOWN; slow official series are not marked stale solely because the observation itself is old. Where a reliable expected-next-release rule is unavailable, the date remains unknown rather than fabricated.\n- Fiscal stale values are ineligible for current fiscal scores/rankings.\n- No export function triggers a data refresh or additional network request.\n\n## Market universe in this release\nCroatia (CROBEX / ZSE) is always included in Markets. Legacy removed markets have no active runtime entry.\n`}
